ation/json\" header","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["d2d4b3f4-cedb-4e57-984f-d69b1800513a"]},{"id":"50e35f43-f444-42b5-af0a-addb055c59cd","text":"The /vouchers/voucher_preactivation response should have a \"message\" property","type":"Outcome","astNodeIds":["b3eadf2e-c249-4035-9da4-2a88cc0f0d8c"]}]}}
